[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9720.469, "timestamp": "02:42:00", "text": "拖延症简直就是魔鬼。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9723.429, "timestamp": "02:42:03", "text": "疯狂的。就像我发现自己变得如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9725.67, "timestamp": "02:42:05", "text": "中间有些走神。就像，哦，哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9727.59, "timestamp": "02:42:07", "text": "嗯，我就做一件事吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9729.91, "timestamp": "02:42:09", "text": "那样的话，你知道，那就太好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9732.55, "timestamp": "02:42:12", "text": "快速浏览一下推特。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9734.63, "timestamp": "02:42:14", "text": "介意我这么做吗？然后它就消失了。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9737.27, "timestamp": "02:42:17", "text": "三个小时就这样过去了。是的，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9738.71, "timestamp": "02:42:18", "text": "至少在流媒体方面，情况是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9740.55, "timestamp": "02:42:20", "text": "比如，哦，你可以跟踪诸如如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9742.95, "timestamp": "02:42:22", "text": "你已经工作很久了。嗯，还有，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9744.71, "timestamp": "02:42:24", "text": "人们进来办理入住手续。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9746.55, "timestamp": "02:42:26", "text": "好吧，这还不错。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9748.71, "timestamp": "02:42:28", "text": "恰到好处的干扰，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9752.15, "timestamp": "02:42:32", "text": "但感觉我能锁定目标。嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9754.389, "timestamp": "02:42:34", "text": "我就是这样开始的。但我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9757.03, "timestamp": "02:42:37", "text": "希望能像这里一样，而我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9759.03, "timestamp": "02:42:39", "text": "就像，“好吧，我想这就是我要做的……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9765.75, "timestamp": "02:42:45", "text": "是的。那真不错。你呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9768.309, "timestamp": "02:42:48", "text": "比如，你为什么开始喜欢管子之类的东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9771.99, "timestamp": "02:42:51", "text": "你是怎么开始的？哦，对我来说，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9775.19, "timestamp": "02:42:55", "text": "我最初的想法是受到启发。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9777.91, "timestamp": "02:42:57", "text": "那它叫什么来着？嗯，我当时也太……"}]